                                                "sense_id": "f88ca59f-147f-3e5a-ad51-6a9bd7434d79",
                                                "text": "Several sections in that book are really confusing."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9719019b-fff4-406e-9bf6-3728d248eabf",
                                                "sense_id": "f88ca59f-147f-3e5a-ad51-6a9bd7434d79",
                                                "text": "The Cleveland Clinic’s Sukol thinks the word “healthy” is confusing and should be replaced with the term “nourishing,” as some processed foods have been marketed as “healthy.”"
